    image: 'https://picsum.photos/seed/bitcoin/800/400',
    category: '挖矿',
    date: '2026-05-11',
    slug: 'bitcoin-mining-low-profit-era'
  },
  {
    title: '紧急预警！JDownloader 下载器遭黑客入侵',
